---
description: How to delete a feature subgraph
title: Delete Feature Subgraph
---

## Description

Delete a feature subgraph within the specified (otherwise "default") namespace. A feature subgraph is an "override" of an existing subgraph.

## Usage

The command to delete the feature subgraph is the same as the subgraph.\
Please refer to [subgraph delete](../subgraph/delete.md).
